At Flix, we offer a dynamic work environment with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a tech-driven approach to making travel more accessible, sustainable, and affordable. &nbsp;

As an Instructional &amp; E-Learning Designer (m/f/d) , you'll help shape the digital learning experience across Flix. You'll create engaging learning content, optimize learning technologies, and support initiatives that enable Flix employees to grow and succeed.&nbsp;

This is a 1-year fixed-term (maternity cover) &nbsp;role based in Warsaw&nbsp;(hybrid model).

About the Role

• Design and create e-learnings and expand the Flix Learning Management System platform - FlixUni - with digital content (i.e. videos, animations, graphics, text-to-speech, AI implementation)

• Support Flix’s continuous international expansion beyond Europe, including supporting our LATAM and India regions

• Translate user needs into efficient and effective projects (e.g. process automation, workflow streamlining, tech improvements, new feature development)

• Focus on UX to further foster user motivation and engagement for digital learning

• Drive continuous improvement, implement new processes and increase usage and acceptance of the LMS globally

• Identify key business needs and set up, execute and deliver projects across various departments within the business

• Manage both existing stakeholders as well as new acquisitions and support with fixing issues (through our JIRA service desk)

About You

• At least 2-3 years of experience in content creation/eLearning design or other creative fields

• Experience administering a Learning Management System (working with Docebo is a plus)

• Passionate and innovative designer with empathy for stakeholder needs

• Proactive mindset, ready to take ownership of projects - both manage and execute

• Experience with agile way of working (Scrum, Kanban, Sprints, quarterly planning etc.)

• Experience with Articulate Software, Vyond, Canva (or other creative tools)

• Fluent in English (important as we create content in English)

We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don't meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &nbsp;

What We Offer

• Travel perks : 12 free Flix vouchers + 12 discount vouchers for friends &amp; family.&nbsp;

• Hybrid work model : We are an office-first company, but we offer flexibility to balance work and life.&nbsp;

• Wellbeing support : Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members.&nbsp;

• Learning &amp; Development : Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills.&nbsp;

• Mentoring Program : Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career.&nbsp;

To view more local benefits specific to each office location, please check out this link:&nbsp; Locations - Flix Career

Why Join Flix?

At Flix, you’ll find teams that rally together to overcome challenges and spark creativity. We believe in ownership culture - giving you the freedom to take initiative, make an impact, and shape your own career path.
As we continue to expand across the globe, you can make a real difference in how we work.

If you’re ready to grow and lead your journey, Flix is the place for you!&nbsp;

